    "block_content": " $$ \\begin{align*}\\|\\mathbb{E}[Z_{b}|\\mathcal{F}_{b-1}]\\|&=\\left\\|\\mathbb{E}\\left[\\frac{b-1}{b}\\hat{Y}_{b-1}+\\frac{\\lambda}{b}S_{n}(Y-\\Gamma_{M}(\\hat{Y}_{b-1}))-Y^{*}\\bigg|\\mathcal{F}_{b-1}\\right]\\right\\|\\\\&=\\left\\|\\frac{b-1}{b}(\\hat{Y}_{b-1}-Y^{*})+\\frac{\\lambda}{b}\\mathbb{E}[S_{n}](Y-\\Gamma_{M}(\\hat{Y}_{b-1}))-\\frac{1}{b}Y^{*}\\right\\|\\\\&\\leq\\frac{b-1}{b}\\left\\|\\hat{Y}_{b-1}-Y^{*}\\right\\|+\\left\\|\\frac{\\lambda}{b}\\mathbb{E}[S_{n}](Y-\\Gamma_{M}(\\hat{Y}_{b-1}))-\\frac{\\lambda}{b}\\mathbb{E}[S_{n}](Y-Y^{*})\\right\\|\\\\&\\leq\\frac{b-1+\\lambda}{b}\\left\\|\\hat{Y}_{b-1}-Y^{*}\\right\\|\\triangleq k_{b}\\left\\|Z_{b-1}\\right\\|,\\end{align*} $$ "
